    "_comments": [
      "Won deals with their invoices' payment state (bc-aidp-next-golive#487): one row per deal, with what was",
      "invoiced, paid and still owed, the payment status and the next due date. The per-invoice rows are the",
      "'Sales: Won Deal Payments' query. Every user sees every deal; narrow to your own with the Owner filter.",
      "",
      "The filter is PaymentStatus IS NOT NULL: the Deals view fills the payment columns only for a won deal",
      "(DealStatusType.IsWon) with an order, so the view needs neither a status name nor a schema name.",
      "GridState matches WonDealPaymentsGridState() in packages/Angular/src/lib/pages/deal-views.ts; a unit test",
      "holds the two together. UserID is the install Owner, as for 'Sales: Pipeline'."
    ],
